# Pre-Flight Check (MANDATORY)

**Before writing or modifying ANY code in `store-front`, you MUST:**

1. Identify which standards apply from the lookup table below.
2. Read those standards (`.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` or `.cursor/rules/<name>.mdc`).
3. Write code following every pattern and invariant.
4. After writing, perform the Post-Write Self-Check.

## Standards Resolution Order

1. Task skill: `.agents/skills/{name}/SKILL.md`
2. Always-on rule: `.cursor/rules/{name}.mdc`

## Rule Lookup Table

